---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy Policy | PanBloom.com"
	description="PanBloom.com Privacy Policy: GDPR, CCPA, and Google AdSense cookie and advertising compliance information."
>
	<div class="policy-page">
		<div class="container policy-container">
			<header class="policy-header">
				<span class="policy-eyebrow">Legal &amp; Privacy</span>
				<h1 class="policy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p class="policy-meta">Effective Date: September 2026 &bull; GDPR &amp; Google Publisher Compliant</p>
			</header>

			<div class="policy-content">
				<section>
					<h2>1. Information We Collect &amp; Data Controller</h2>
					<p>
						<strong>PanBloom.com</strong> is published and operated by <strong>SATMAT DIGITAL LTD</strong> ("we", "us", or "our"), a private company limited by shares registered in England and Wales (Registered Office: 308 St. Pauls Road, London, England N1 2LF, SIC: 47910). SATMAT DIGITAL LTD serves as the Data Controller responsible for your personal data under the General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and international data privacy statutes.
					</p>
					<p>
						We collect minimal personal data, primarily through standard web server logs (IP address, browser type, referring pages) and cookie identifiers used to deliver core site functionality, performance telemetry, and programmatic advertising.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>2. Google AdSense &amp; Advertising Cookies</h2>
					<p>
						We use third-party vendors, including <strong>Google</strong>, to serve ads when you visit our website:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>
							Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.
						</li>
						<li>
							Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
						</li>
						<li>
							Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>3. GDPR &amp; CCPA Rights</h2>
					<p>
						If you reside within the European Economic Area (EEA) or California, you have the right to request access to, deletion of, or restriction of your personal data. We comply with all regional consent management frameworks (CMP).
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>4. Contact Us Regarding Privacy</h2>
					<p>
						For questions about this Privacy Policy or your personal information, contact our Data Protection Officer at <code>privacy@panbloom.com</code>.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.policy-page {
		padding: 3.5rem 0 5rem;
	}

	.policy-container {
		max-width: 820px;
	}

	.policy-header {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.policy-eyebrow {
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-blue-primary);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.policy-title {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: var(--color-text-dark);
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
	}

	.policy-meta {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.policy-content {
		color: #334155;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.policy-content section {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.policy-content h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--color-text-dark);
		margin: 1.75rem 0 0.75rem 0;
	}

	.policy-content p {
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.policy-content ul {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	.policy-content li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.policy-content a {
		color: var(--color-blue-primary);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
</style>
